  "product": {
    "id": 9818309034303,
    "title": "Custom Vinyl Stickers",
    "body_html": "\u003Cp class=\"__prematched-text-block\"\u003EPremade Custom Stickers Sample $0.01 - \u003Ca data-vrntid=\"50397083402559\" title=\"Add to Cart\" class=\"lnkcolor\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to Cart\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur custom vinyl stickers are made from premium, weatherproof vinyl designed to last indoors and outdoors. Whether you’re branding products, decorating laptops, or creating promotional stickers, our printed vinyl stickers deliver vibrant color and long-lasting 2+ year outdoor durability.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003EOur proprietary EasyPeel tab allows a fast safe peel every time, protecting your sticker from being bent or damaged while peeling your sticker.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAll Sticker Orders Ship FREE\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
